#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0590 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: A variable is present with the same name as a variable present in ADSL but the variables do not have identical data types
#note "No ADSL in the study: $adsl_data_type has no value, the not empty($adsl_data_type) gate folds false, and the rule cannot fire. Pins the absent-ADSL disposition of the cross-dataset probe."
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AGE type=Num label="Age"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 63
---
